{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 38, :comments ["<b>And this is what you shall do upon the altar.</b> This 'doing' is the arrangement of the limbs upon the pyres of fire, and it would take place at sunrise; but the slaughtering of the daily offering (תמיד) took place beforehand, at the time the east grew light. And six priests would perform the offering: one would carry the leg and the head, the second the two forelegs, the third the hindquarters and the leg, the fourth the breast and the neck, the fifth the two flanks, the sixth the innards."], :book :exodus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:05:22.038873546Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}